        "content": "<p>pchickey opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14449\">PR #14449</a> from <code>pchickey:winch-default-features-gc</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Winch support for exceptions (which requires gc types) is in progress, however, it is not yet considered complete enough to be Tier 1 supported, so it needs to be off by default.</p>\n<p>Tests which exercise this functionality now opt in.</p>\n<p>The docs now better reflects that Winch does not yet have complete Tier 1 support for exceptions and gc types.</p>\n</blockquote>",
